<title>USA: Alabama jobless rate dips to 4.4 pct in January.</title>
<headline>Alabama jobless rate dips to 4.4 pct in January.</headline>
<dateline>MONTGOMERY, Ala 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alabama's unemployment rate fell to 4.4 percent in January, a drop of nearly a full point since December, the state Department of Industrial Relations said Friday.</p>
<p>The unemployment rate was Alabama's lowest since 1978.</p>
<p>--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013</p>
</text>
